     "en": "Added DigiPay as a new payment gateway: enable it from Extensions > Payment and enter your DigiPay connection details (Client ID, Client Secret, username and password). The customer is redirected to DigiPay's own page to finish paying - depending on what your DigiPay merchant account has enabled, they can pay by bank card, DigiPay wallet, or buy-now-pay-later/installment credit, all from the same gateway with no separate setup needed. Credit/BNPL purchases require DigiPay to be separately told once the goods are delivered - set a trigger order status in DigiPay's settings, and this is reported automatically the moment an order paid that way reaches that status (whether changed from the admin panel or automatically). A sandbox/test mode was also added, matching BitPay and ZarinPal, so the gateway can be tried against DigiPay's staging environment before going live. Note: DigiPay's refund/reversal actions are not implemented in this version (consistent with every other gateway in this store)."
