+    "en": "Redesigned the \"Trust Badges & License Seals\" section under Settings > General: it used to be a single textarea where you had to paste every badge's code (Enamad, licenses, payment gateway logos) concatenated together; now each badge has its own row with a \"Name\" field (for your own reference, e.g. \"Enamad\") next to its \"HTML Code\" field. Use the \"Add Badge\" button to add a new row, edit any row directly, and remove one with the red button next to it. Any badges already saved in the old textarea are automatically carried over - with nothing lost - into a single row named \"Previous badges\"; after updating, just open the settings page and split them into separate rows if you'd like. How badges are displayed on the storefront footer is unchanged."
